---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Tesora AI — actuarial pricing for specialty property and casualty"
  description="AI-native actuarial pricing for specialty P&C. Built for chief actuaries, carrier executives, MGAs, and reinsurance brokers who price hard-to-rate lines."
  canonical="/"
  schemaType="WebPage"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500">Tesora AI</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-5xl leading-tight text-neutral-900">
      Specialty P&amp;C pricing isn't a market problem. It's a data problem.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
      Three to five points of loss-ratio leakage in contractor's GL, excess casualty,
      and professional lines isn't social inflation or nuclear verdicts. It's exposure
      bases captured wrong on day one, schedule-rating credits that run on vibes, and
      GLMs trained on data the rater never saw clean. Tesora fixes the data and the
      model together.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-neutral-900 pl-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500">Site under reconstruction</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-neutral-700">
        Design system in progress. Long-form pages on lines, audiences, and concepts
        are in production. Reach out if you want to talk specialty P&amp;C pricing
        before the new site lands.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
